From: mix2-port <mix2@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Bluetooth: hci_qca: mark LE Read Transmit Power broken on WCN399x

The WCN3990 in the Xiaomi Mi MIX 2 advertises LE Read Transmit Power
but answers it with a status-only event:

  Bluetooth: hci0: unexpected cc 0x204b length: 1 < 3
  Bluetooth: hci0: Opcode 0x204b failed: -38

which aborts controller initialisation. Skip the command on WCN399x.
---
 drivers/bluetooth/hci_qca.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/drivers/bluetooth/hci_qca.c
+++ b/drivers/bluetooth/hci_qca.c
@@ -1947,6 +1947,7 @@ static int qca_setup(struct hci_uart *hu)
 	case QCA_WCN3991:
 	case QCA_WCN3998:
 		soc_name = "wcn399x";
+		hci_set_quirk(hdev, HCI_QUIRK_BROKEN_READ_TRANSMIT_POWER);
 		break;
 
 	case QCA_WCN6750:
